§ CSLv3 TOKENIZER OPTIMIZATION
I> elevated from v2-specs §12 appendix → full spec file
I> reconciled: pasted (D1 D8 ASCII mandate), specs/ (cost table, anti-patterns)
W! every glyph W! have measured BPE cost
W! every glyph W! have ASCII alias (J-style dual-mode)
W! prefer ASCII alias when unicode glyph costs ≥ 3 BPE tokens

§ DESIGN PRINCIPLE
  I> token budget = cognition budget
  I> wasted tokens = wasted reasoning
  I> glyph ROI = (frequency × semantic-bits) / BPE-token-cost
  W! glyph w/ ROI < 1.0 → candidate for removal or ASCII-only

§ BPE TOKEN COST TABLE (Claude/GPT-4 estimates)

§§ COST-1 (single BPE token — always prefer)
| element      | tok | notes                              |
|--------------|-----|------------------------------------|
| §            | 1   | section marker                     |
| ->           | 1   | flow (ASCII for →)                 |
| =>           | 1   | implies (ASCII for ⇒)              |
| ::           | 1   | type-of                            |
| ..           | 1   | range                              |
| ✓            | 1   | confirmed                          |
| ○            | 1   | pending                            |
| fn           | 1   | function keyword                   |
| def          | 1   | definition keyword                 |
| let          | 1   | binding keyword                    |
| pub          | 1   | export keyword                     |
| use          | 1   | import keyword                     |
| all          | 1   | universal quantifier (ASCII for ∀) |
| any          | 1   | existential quantifier (ASCII for ∃)|
| enum         | 1   | enumeration keyword                |
| .            | 0-1 | often merged into surrounding      |
| + - * / %    | 1   | arithmetic                         |
| = < > ! ?    | 1   | comparison / control               |
| @ # $ & ,  ; | 1   | structural                         |
| ( ) [ ] { }  | 1   | enclosures                         |

§§ COST-2 (2 BPE tokens — acceptable, high-frequency justifies)
| element      | tok | notes                              |
|--------------|-----|------------------------------------|
| W!           | 2   | must — very high freq, justified   |
| R!           | 2   | should — high freq, justified      |
| I>           | 2   | insight — high freq, justified     |
| M?           | 2   | may — medium freq                  |
| N!           | 2   | must-not — medium freq             |
| Q?           | 2   | question — medium freq             |
| P>           | 2   | push-further — low freq, worth it  |
| D>           | 2   | decision — low freq                |
| !=           | 2   | not-equal                          |
| <=           | 2   | less-or-equal                      |
| >=           | 2   | greater-or-equal                   |
| |>           | 2   | pipeline forward                   |
| <|           | 2   | pipeline backward                  |
| ~>           | 2   | causes/triggers                    |
| >>           | 2   | dispatch                           |
| <<           | 2   | receive                            |
| ◐            | 1-2 | partial — variable by tokenizer    |
| ✗            | 1-2 | failed — variable by tokenizer     |
| 'd 'f 's ... | 2   | type suffixes (quote + letter)     |

§§ COST-2-3 (2-3 BPE tokens — use when semantic value justifies)
| element      | tok | ASCII alias | use-when                   |
|--------------|-----|-------------|----------------------------|
| →            | 2-3 | ->          | prefer ASCII in most contexts |
| ←            | 2-3 | <-          | prefer ASCII               |
| ↔            | 2-3 | <->         | prefer ASCII               |
| ⇒            | 2-3 | =>          | prefer ASCII               |
| ∀            | 2   | all         | prefer ASCII               |
| ∃            | 2   | any         | prefer ASCII               |
| ∈            | 2   | in          | prefer ASCII               |
| ∉            | 2   | !in         | prefer ASCII               |
| ⊂            | 2   | <:          | prefer ASCII               |
| ∴            | 2   | .:.         | prefer ASCII               |
| ∵            | 2   | :..         | prefer ASCII               |
| ⊕            | 2   | xor         | acceptable                 |
| ⊗            | 2   | x*          | bahuvrihi — worth the cost |
| ⟨ ⟩          | 2ea | <\| \|>     | record/tuple — worth it    |
| ⟦ ⟧          | 2ea | [[ ]]       | formula — worth it         |
| ⌈ ⌉          | 2ea | [^ ^]       | constraint — worth it      |
| ⌊ ⌋          | 2ea | [_ _]       | precondition — worth it    |

§§ COST-3+ (3+ BPE tokens — ⚠ ASCII alias strongly preferred)
| element      | tok | ASCII alias | justification              |
|--------------|-----|-------------|----------------------------|
| ⟪ ⟫          | 3ea | <<T>>       | temporal — rare, alias     |
| « »          | 2-3 | <<Q>>       | quotation — rare, alias    |
| ɴ ꜱ ʙ ᴠ ᴍ ʈ | 3-5 | 'n 'str etc | type class markers → alias |
| ⍟ ⍋ ⍳        | 3-4 | @. sort iota| APL ops → always alias     |
| ⟲ ⤓ ⤒ ⟐      | 3-4 | loop vv ^^ <>| reason glyphs → alias   |
| ★            | 2-3 | *!          | key insight → alias        |
| ✎            | 2-3 | //          | note-to-self → alias       |
| ‼            | 2   | [!!]        | proven — borderline        |
| ⊘            | 2-3 | [?]         | unknown — prefer ASCII     |
| △ ▽          | 2   | [^] [v]     | hypo/deprecated — alias    |
| ¬            | 2   | ~           | negation — alias works     |
| ∧ ∨          | 2   | && \|\|     | logic — prefer ASCII       |
| ∎            | 2-3 | QED         | block-end — prefer ASCII   |

